    "created_at": "2024-06-20T15:22:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-20T15:22:35Z",
    "body": "It's part of the design principles right now: https://w3ctag.github.io/design-principles/#always-add-event-handlers so I figured it's still a pattern that we encourage. If that's not the case, then we should probably change the design principles and figure out if anything needs to be done with the existing `on*` attributes. I don't have a strong opinion either way",
